# Text files are checked out ending lines with LF on every platform, as
# Spotless and Checkstyle hold the sources to LF on each.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The exception: cmd.exe misreads a batch file's labels in LF lines, so
# the Gradle wrapper's batch file keeps CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# The wrapper's jar is binary.
*.jar binary
